OL,3,GNEWSAHigher parking fees help council
OL,4,Abank extra #1.6m
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn increase in off-street car park
OL,7,Fcharges has helped bring in an
OL,8,Fadditional #1.6m for a council.
OL,10,FCambridge City Council increased
OL,11,Foff-street tariffs by an average of 20%
OL,12,Flast year, and scrapped free overnight
OL,13,Fparking at several car parks.
OL,15,FIt said the additional income was due
OL,16,Fto the changes and "strong demand" at
OL,17,Fthe Grand Arcade, Park Street and Queen
OL,18,FAnne Terrace car parks.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
