OL,3,GNEWSAHigher parking fees help council
OL,4,Abank extra #1.6m
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the council said:
OL,7,F"Cambridge is a thriving, prosperous
OL,8,Fcity, and demand for our car parks was
OL,9,Fhigher than anticipated."
